{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-data-types","title":"代数数据类型与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/type-systems/algebraic-data-types","wordCount":899,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代数数据类型与模式匹配\">代数数据类型与模式匹配</h1><p>代数数据类型（Algebraic Data Types, ADT）是函数式编程中建模数据的核心工具。与面向对象编程用类继承来表示变体不同，ADT 用**积类型（Product Type）<strong>和</strong>和类型（Sum Type）**的组合来精确描述数据的所有可能形态。搭配模式匹配（Pattern Matching），ADT 让编译器替你检查是否覆盖了所有情况——遗漏一个分支就会收到警告，而不是留下隐藏的运行时 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ADT 的设计哲学是通过类型的代数组合精确描述数据的所有合法状态，使得非法状态在编译时就不可构造。积类型（AND）组合必须同时存在的字段，和类型（OR）表示互斥的变体，模式匹配则提供对这些结构的安全解构——编译器强制处理所有分支，遗漏即报错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积类型与和类型\">积类型与和类型</h2><p>ADT 的名字来自代数——它真的遵循代数运算规则。</p>\n<p><strong>积类型（Product Type）<strong>对应逻辑「与」：一个值同时包含所有字段。元组 <code>(A, B)</code> 和结构体/record 都是积类型。其取值空间大小等于各字段取值空间的</strong>乘积</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>和类型（Sum Type）<strong>对应逻辑「或」：一个值是多个变体中的</strong>恰好一个</strong>。其取值空间大小等于各变体取值空间的<strong>加和</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A \\times B| = |A| \\times |B| \\qquad |A + B| = |A| + |B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    ADT[代数数据类型]&#10;    ADT --&gt; Product[&quot;积类型 A × B&quot;]&#10;    ADT --&gt; Sum[&quot;和类型 A + B&quot;]&#10;    Product --&gt; Tuple[&quot;元组 (Int, String)&quot;]&#10;    Product --&gt; Record[&quot;记录 {name: String, age: Int}&quot;]&#10;    Sum --&gt; Option[&quot;Option = Some A | None&quot;]&#10;    Sum --&gt; Result[&quot;Result = Ok A | Err E&quot;]&#10;    Sum --&gt; Tree[&quot;Tree = Leaf | Node Tree A Tree&quot;]\">graph LR\n    ADT[代数数据类型]\n    ADT --&gt; Product[\"积类型 A × B\"]\n    ADT --&gt; Sum[\"和类型 A + B\"]\n    Product --&gt; Tuple[\"元组 (Int, String)\"]\n    Product --&gt; Record[\"记录 {name: String, age: Int}\"]\n    Sum --&gt; Option[\"Option = Some A | None\"]\n    Sum --&gt; Result[\"Result = Ok A | Err E\"]\n    Sum --&gt; Tree[\"Tree = Leaf | Node Tree A Tree\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型种类</th>\n<th>代数类比</th>\n<th>取值空间</th>\n<th>语言示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unit</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>单一值</td>\n<td><code>()</code> / <code>void</code> / <code>Unit</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积类型</td>\n<td>乘法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A| \\times |B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>(A, B)</code> / <code>struct</code> / <code>record</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和类型</td>\n<td>加法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A| + |B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>enum</code> / <code>sealed trait</code> / <code>union</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数类型</td>\n<td>幂</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|^{|A|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>A -&gt; B</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式匹配-解构的艺术\">模式匹配：解构的艺术</h2><p>模式匹配是 ADT 的天然搭档——它对和类型的每个变体进行分支处理，对积类型的字段进行解构绑定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust: 定义一个 AST 节点&#10;enum Expr {&#10;    Lit(i64),&#10;    Add(Box&lt;Expr&gt;, Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;    Mul(Box&lt;Expr&gt;, Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;    Neg(Box&lt;Expr&gt;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模式匹配实现求值&#10;fn eval(expr: &amp;Expr) -&gt; i64 {&#10;    match expr {&#10;        Expr::Lit(n) =&gt; *n,&#10;        Expr::Add(a, b) =&gt; eval(a) + eval(b),&#10;        Expr::Mul(a, b) =&gt; eval(a) * eval(b),&#10;        Expr::Neg(e) =&gt; -eval(e),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust: 定义一个 AST 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Lit(i64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Add(Box&#x3C;Expr>, Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Mul(Box&#x3C;Expr>, Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Neg(Box&#x3C;Expr>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 模式匹配实现求值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn eval(expr: &#x26;Expr) -> i64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match expr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Lit(n) => *n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Add(a, b) => eval(a) + eval(b),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Mul(a, b) => eval(a) * eval(b),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Expr::Neg(e) => -eval(e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器的穷尽性检查（exhaustiveness check）是 ADT + 模式匹配的杀手锏：当你新增一个变体但忘记处理它时，编译器会在所有相关的 match 表达式上报错。这将「遗漏分支」从运行时 bug 提升为编译时错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使非法状态不可表示\">使非法状态不可表示</h2><p>ADT 的设计哲学是「Make Illegal States Unrepresentable」。通过精确选择类型组合，让类型系统排除所有无意义的状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 糟糕：用字符串表示状态&#10;type Order = {&#10;  status: string; // &quot;pending&quot; | &quot;shipped&quot; | &quot;delivered&quot; — 但可以是任何字符串&#10;  trackingNumber?: string; // 什么时候有值？不清楚&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 优秀：ADT 让每种状态携带且仅携带相关数据&#10;type Order =&#10;  | { tag: &#39;pending&#39;; items: Item[] }&#10;  | { tag: &#39;shipped&#39;; items: Item[]; trackingNumber: string }&#10;  | { tag: &#39;delivered&#39;; items: Item[]; trackingNumber: string; deliveredAt: Date };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 糟糕：用字符串表示状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"pending\" | \"shipped\" | \"delivered\" — 但可以是任何字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trackingNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 什么时候有值？不清楚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优秀：ADT 让每种状态携带且仅携带相关数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trackingNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trackingNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deliveredAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在上面的设计中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pending</code> 订单不可能有 <code>trackingNumber</code>——类型系统不允许</li>\n<li><code>shipped</code> 订单一定有 <code>trackingNumber</code>——不可能为空</li>\n<li><code>deliveredAt</code> 只在 <code>delivered</code> 状态存在</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"递归类型与数据结构\">递归类型与数据结构</h2><p>ADT 的强大之处在于它可以自然地表示递归数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 列表是最经典的递归 ADT&#10;data List a = Nil | Cons a (List a)&#10;&#10;-- 二叉树&#10;data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)&#10;&#10;-- JSON 值&#10;data JsonValue&#10;  = JsonNull&#10;  | JsonBool Bool&#10;  | JsonNumber Double&#10;  | JsonString String&#10;  | JsonArray [JsonValue]&#10;  | JsonObject [(String, JsonValue)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 列表是最经典的递归 ADT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data List a = Nil | Cons a (List a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 二叉树</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- JSON 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data JsonValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = JsonNull</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | JsonBool Bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | JsonNumber Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | JsonString String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | JsonArray [JsonValue]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | JsonObject [(String, JsonValue)]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>递归类型 + 模式匹配 + 递归函数，三者形成完美的三位一体：类型定义数据形状，模式匹配解构每个变体，递归函数沿着类型结构自然展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨语言的-adt-支持现状\">跨语言的 ADT 支持现状</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>和类型语法</th>\n<th>穷尽性检查</th>\n<th>深度模式匹配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td><code>data T = A | B</code></td>\n<td>编译器警告</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td><code>enum T { A, B }</code></td>\n<td>编译器错误</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala 3</td>\n<td><code>enum T { case A; case B }</code></td>\n<td>sealed + 警告</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td><code>type T = A | B</code>（tagged union）</td>\n<td><code>never</code> 穷尽</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin</td>\n<td><code>sealed class/interface</code></td>\n<td><code>when</code> 穷尽</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java 21+</td>\n<td><code>sealed interface</code> + <code>record</code></td>\n<td><code>switch</code> 穷尽</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OCaml</td>\n<td><code>type t = A | B</code></td>\n<td>编译器警告</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADT = 积类型（同时持有所有字段） + 和类型（恰好是一种变体）</li>\n<li>模式匹配对 ADT 做解构，编译器穷尽性检查防止遗漏</li>\n<li>设计目标：Make Illegal States Unrepresentable</li>\n<li>递归 ADT 自然表示树、列表等结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"type-inference-polymorphism\">类型推断与参数多态</a> — ADT 如何与泛型协作实现通用数据结构</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../type-systems/advanced-types-and-significance/algebraic-data-types\">类型系统 hub：代数数据类型</a> — 从类型论视角深入 ADT 的形式化基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代数数据类型与模式匹配","id":"代数数据类型与模式匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"积类型与和类型","id":"积类型与和类型"},{"level":2,"text":"模式匹配：解构的艺术","id":"模式匹配-解构的艺术"},{"level":2,"text":"使非法状态不可表示","id":"使非法状态不可表示"},{"level":2,"text":"递归类型与数据结构","id":"递归类型与数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"跨语言的 ADT 支持现状","id":"跨语言的-adt-支持现状"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Lambda 演算与引用透明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/foundations/lambda-calculus-referential-transparency"},"next":{"title":"类型推断与参数多态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/type-systems/type-inference-polymorphism"}}